<h1>HL-104 Backup power</h1>
<p>Edition 1, in force from 1 March 2026.</p>
<h2>2 Requirement</h2>
<p>An entrance light shall keep working for at least 24 hours after mains power is lost.</p>
<footer><p>SYNTHETIC: this page was invented for the harvest skill's example. The Harbour Lighting Standards Board does not exist.</p></footer>
